  "goodToKnow": "Der Hausherr (die Hausherrin) is the master of the house or host: Der Hausherr bat zu Tisch. The Hausherr has das Hausrecht, the right to decide who may enter. Sports journalists call the home team die Hausherren or die Gastgeber, and the visitors die Gäste. Like Herr, it takes -n in the singular oblique cases: den Hausherrn. Plural: die Hausherren."
